0..55 Comment "// This source defines effect rows as free-model trees."
56..58 Comment "//"
59..128 Comment "// A program holds a result or a row operation with its continuation."
129..205 Comment "// The row is a sum of signatures, after Swierstra, \"Data types à la carte\""
206..282 Comment "// (2008). A handler is a fold of the free model, after Plotkin and Pretnar."
283..285 Comment "//"
286..338 Comment "// The row type prevents operations outside the row."
